@startuml
autonumber
actor "Gym User" as User
participant "LoginActivity" as UI
participant "RestClient" as Net
database "RestDB (REST API)" as API
participant "InvalidCredentialsException" as Ex

activate User
User -> UI : submits credentials
activate UI

UI -> Net : makeRequest(url, "GET", null, apiKey, callback)
activate Net

Net -> API : GET /rest/users?q={"email":"...","password":"..."}
activate API
API --> Net : 200 OK (empty array: "[]")
deactivate API

Net --> UI : onSuccess("[]")
deactivate Net

note right of UI: Detects result.length() <= 2\n(no matching user record)

UI -> Ex ** : throw new InvalidCredentialsException("Invalid credentials or account does not exist.")
activate Ex
Ex --> UI : exception instance
deactivate Ex

note right of UI: try-catch block catches InvalidCredentialsException\nand triggers Toast.makeText()

UI -> User : shows Toast with e.getMessage()
deactivate UI
deactivate User
@enduml
